ase  </c><00:00:01.062><c>is </c><00:00:01.063><c>more </c><00:00:01.064><c>polar </c><00:00:01.065><c>than </c><00:00:01.066><c>our </c><00:00:01.067><c>solvent  </c><00:00:01.068><c>and </c><00:00:01.069><c>so </c><00:00:01.070><c>the </c><00:00:01.071><c>things </c><00:00:01.072><c>that </c><00:00:01.073><c>are </c><00:00:01.074><c>more </c><00:00:01.075><c>polar  </c><00:00:01.076><c>were </c><00:00:01.077><c>harder </c><00:00:01.078><c>to </c><00:00:01.079><c>move  </c><00:00:01.080><c>by </c><00:00:01.081><c>the </c><00:00:01.082><c>less </c><00:00:01.083><c>polar </c><00:00:01.084><c>solvent</c>

